{"id":"465b7969801bc890","group":"56","path":"56/56-cor-finite-family-history-support.md","title":"有限家族与历史支持接口补记","display":"cor-finite-family-history-support — 有限家族与历史支持接口补记","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-cor-finite-family-history-support","aliases":["56-cor-finite-family-history-support"],"display":"cor-finite-family-history-support — 有限家族与历史支持接口补记","depends_on":["[[56-thm-finite-family-developments]]","[[56-df-levy-target-family-support]]"],"reconstructed":"2026-10-19","reconstruction_basis":"supplied-book-56-files","historical_record_status":"original-record-not-supplied"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-cor-finite-family-history-support"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-cor-finite-family-history-support</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-finite-family-history-support — 有限家族与历史支持接口补记"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"59b32ea2cec82a1a\" href=\"?note=59b32ea2cec82a1a\" title=\"56-thm-finite-family-developments\">56-thm-finite-family-developments</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"31a340e08cd89ad6\" href=\"?note=31a340e08cd89ad6\" title=\"56-df-levy-target-family-support\">56-df-levy-target-family-support</a></span></div>"},{"key":"reconstructed","html":"2026-10-19"},{"key":"reconstruction_basis","html":"supplied-book-56-files"},{"key":"historical_record_status","html":"original-record-not-supplied"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定左线性项重写系统 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>。标记项集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_R^L\">\\(T_R^L\\)</span>、模式度域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M_R\">\\(\\mathcal M_R\\)</span>、具体红项编码集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_R\">\\(\\mathcal E_R\\)</span> 及无限家族发展谓词采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"59b32ea2cec82a1a\" href=\"?note=59b32ea2cec82a1a\" title=\"56-thm-finite-family-developments\">56-thm-finite-family-developments</a> 及其上游。标记签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\\Sigma_R\">\\(\\mathcal L\\Sigma_R\\)</span>、递归子标签集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TSLab}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{TSLab}_R\\)</span> 及家族支持 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FamSupp}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{FamSupp}_R\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"31a340e08cd89ad6\" href=\"?note=31a340e08cd89ad6\" title=\"56-df-levy-target-family-support\">56-df-levy-target-family-support</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_f(A)\">\\(\\mathcal P_f(A)\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的有限子集族。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall D\\in\\mathcal P_f(\\mathcal M_R)\\;\n\\neg\\exists\\boldsymbol{\\hat s}\\in(T_R^L)^{\\mathbb N}\\;\n\\exists\\boldsymbol u\\in\\mathcal E_R^{\\mathbb N}\\;\n\\operatorname{InfFamDev}_R(\\boldsymbol{\\hat s},\\boldsymbol u,D).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall D\\in\\mathcal P_f(\\mathcal M_R)\\;\n\\neg\\exists\\boldsymbol{\\hat s}\\in(T_R^L)^{\\mathbb N}\\;\n\\exists\\boldsymbol u\\in\\mathcal E_R^{\\mathbb N}\\;\n\\operatorname{InfFamDev}_R(\\boldsymbol{\\hat s},\\boldsymbol u,D).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall Y\\in T_R^L\\;\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{TSLab}_R(Y)\\in\\mathcal P_f(\\mathcal L\\Sigma_R)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{FamSupp}_R(Y)\\in\\mathcal P_f(\\mathcal M_R)\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall Y\\in T_R^L\\;\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{TSLab}_R(Y)\\in\\mathcal P_f(\\mathcal L\\Sigma_R)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{FamSupp}_R(Y)\\in\\mathcal P_f(\\mathcal M_R)\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本节点保留输入修订补记中已给出的数学断言，并依其数学内容规范名称及类型。原文件的历史重建信息仍记录在元数据中；数学含义由前两段和所列第 56 本内部依赖确定。</p>\n<p>第一个结论是由 Lévy 深度投影与 HW 有界归约得到的 FFD；它允许空规则集、空预选度集及任意合法中间标记项。第二个结论只使用有限项和标签的有限递归结构，不预先假设任何 needed 路径有限。正交系统中连接固定正规形与 needed 步度界的进一步接口保存在 56 内部相应引理；这里不增加最优策略或未提供的图实现。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-thm-finite-family-developments","status":"resolved","id":"59b32ea2cec82a1a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-finite-family-developments]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-levy-target-family-support","status":"resolved","id":"31a340e08cd89ad6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-levy-target-family-support]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-finite-family-developments","status":"resolved","id":"59b32ea2cec82a1a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定左线性项重写系统 $R$。标记项集 $T_R^L$、模式度域 $\\mathcal M_R$、具体红项编码集 $\\mathcal E_R$ 及无限家族发展谓词采用 [[56-thm-finite-family-developments]] 及其上游。标记签名 $\\mathcal L\\Sigma_R$、递归子标签集 $\\operatorname{TSLab}_R$ 及家族支持 $\\operatorname{FamSupp}_R$ 采用 [[56-df-levy-target-family-support]]；$\\mathcal P_f(A)$ 是 $A$ 的有限子集族。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-levy-target-family-support","status":"resolved","id":"31a340e08cd89ad6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定左线性项重写系统 $R$。标记项集 $T_R^L$、模式度域 $\\mathcal M_R$、具体红项编码集 $\\mathcal E_R$ 及无限家族发展谓词采用 [[56-thm-finite-family-developments]] 及其上游。标记签名 $\\mathcal L\\Sigma_R$、递归子标签集 $\\operatorname{TSLab}_R$ 及家族支持 $\\operatorname{FamSupp}_R$ 采用 [[56-df-levy-target-family-support]]；$\\mathcal P_f(A)$ 是 $A$ 的有限子集族。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"T_R^L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L\\Sigma_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TSLab}_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FamSupp}_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_f(A)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall D\\in\\mathcal P_f(\\mathcal M_R)\\;\n\\neg\\exists\\boldsymbol{\\hat s}\\in(T_R^L)^{\\mathbb N}\\;\n\\exists\\boldsymbol u\\in\\mathcal E_R^{\\mathbb N}\\;\n\\operatorname{InfFamDev}_R(\\boldsymbol{\\hat s},\\boldsymbol u,D).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall Y\\in T_R^L\\;\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{TSLab}_R(Y)\\in\\mathcal P_f(\\mathcal L\\Sigma_R)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{FamSupp}_R(Y)\\in\\mathcal P_f(\\mathcal M_R)\n\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":2102,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-356","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-cor-finite-family-history-support.md]]"}],"outgoing":["59b32ea2cec82a1a","31a340e08cd89ad6"]}